</html>", "title": "Glow Orb - Keep the orb bouncing!", "description": "A physics-based arcade game where you launch projectiles to keep a glowing orb bouncing.", "instructions": "Use mouse to aim the launcher, click or press SPACE to fire projectiles at the glowing orb to keep it bouncing. Don't let it hit the floor!"}